<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Document</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="css/style.css">
    <style>
        {{{inlineResetStyles}}}
        {{{inlineStyles}}}
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="page">
        <header>
            <div class="text--right txt txt--xs">PC-G-17.0F (Rev. 8-2025)</div>
            <div class="text--center">
                <h2 class="mt-16 uppercase">PROBATE COURT OF FRANKLIN COUNTY, OHIO</h2>
                <h4 class="uppercase">JEFFREY D. MACKEY, JUDGE</h4>
            </div>
        </header>
        <div class="content">
            <div class="flex v--end h--start gap-4">
                <div class="txt txt--m uppercase w-auto">
                    <p>GUARDIANSHIP OF</p>
                </div>
                <div class="input fullw">{{caseDetailsStep.inTheMatterOfTheGuardianshipOf}}</div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex v--end h--start gap-4 mt-16">
                <div class="txt txt--m uppercase w-auto">
                    <p>CASE NO.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="input w-auto mw-200">{{caseDetailsStep.caseNumber}}</div>
            </div>
            <div class="text--center mt-20">
                <h2>PROSPECTIVE WARD'S FINANCIAL INFORMATION</h2>
            </div>
            <div class="mt-16 grid gap-16">
              <div class="txt txt--s">
                <p>The prospective ward’s finances include the following. <strong>[Check all boxes that apply.]</strong></p>
              </div>
              <div class="txt txt--s mt-10">
                <p><strong>Benefits:</strong></p>
              </div>
              <div class="flex v--end h--between gap-4">
                <div class="checkbox">{{#includes benefitsStep.benefit "socialSecurity"}}✓{{/includes}}</div>
                <div class="txt txt--s w-auto">Social Security:</div>
                <div class="input fullw">{{benefitsStep.socialSecurity.socialSecuritySize}}</div>
                <div class="txt txt--s mw-300">
                  per month
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="flex v--end h--between gap-4 pl-30">
                <div class="checkbox ml-30">{{#if benefitsStep.socialSecurity.representativePayeeName}}✓{{/if}}</div>
                <div class="txt txt--s w-auto">There is a representative payee:</div>
                <div class="input fullw">{{benefitsStep.socialSecurity.representativePayeeName}}</div>
              </div>

              <div class="flex v--end h--between gap-4">
                <div class="checkbox">{{#includes benefitsStep.benefit "PERS"}}✓{{/includes}}</div>
                <div class="txt txt--s w-auto">P.E.R.S.:</div>
                <div class="input fullw">{{benefitsStep.PERS.size}}</div>
                <div class="txt txt--s mw-300">
                  per month
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="flex v--end h--between gap-4">
                <div class="checkbox">{{#includes benefitsStep.benefit "VABenefits"}}✓{{/includes}}</div>
                <div class="txt txt--s w-auto">V.A. Benefits:</div>
                <div class="input fullw">{{benefitsStep.VABenefits.size}}</div>
                <div class="txt txt--s mw-300">
                  per month
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="flex v--end h--between gap-4">
                <div class="checkbox">{{#includes benefitsStep.benefit "railroadRetirement"}}✓{{/includes}}</div>
                <div class="txt txt--s w-auto">Railroad Retirement:</div>
                <div class="input fullw">{{benefitsStep.railroadRetirement.size}}</div>
                <div class="txt txt--s mw-300">
                  per month
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="flex v--end h--between gap-4">
                <div class="checkbox">{{#includes benefitsStep.benefit "otherPension"}}✓{{/includes}}</div>
                <div class="txt txt--s w-auto">Other Pension(s):</div>
                <div class="input fullw">{{benefitsStep.otherPension.describeOtherPensionSize}}</div>
                <div class="txt txt--s mw-300">
                  per month
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="flex v--end h--between gap-4 pl-30">
                <div class="txt txt--s w-auto">Source:</div>
                <div class="input fullw">{{benefitsStep.otherPension.sourceOfOtherPension}}</div>
              </div>

              <div class="flex v--end h--start gap-4">
                <div class="checkbox">{{#includes benefitsStep.benefit "medicaid"}}✓{{/includes}}</div>
                <div class="txt txt--s w-auto">Medicaid</div>
              </div>
              <div class="flex v--start h--start gap-4 pl-30">
                <div class="checkbox ml-30">{{#if benefitsStep.medicaid.isWardMedicaidFacilityResident}}✓{{/if}}</div>
                <div class="txt txt--s w-auto">The prospective ward is eligible for Medicaid AND lives in a nursing home or other facility which receives all of the prospective ward’s income.</div>
              </div>

              <div class="flex v--end h--between gap-4">
                <div class="checkbox">{{#includes benefitsStep.benefit "otherInsuranceBenefits"}}✓{{/includes}}</div>
                <div class="txt txt--s w-auto">Other Insurance Benefits:</div>
                <div class="input fullw"></div>
              </div>

              <div class="flex v--end h--between gap-4">
                <div class="checkbox">{{#includes benefitsStep.benefit "other"}}✓{{/includes}}</div>
                <div class="txt txt--s w-auto">Other:</div>
                <div class="input fullw">{{benefitsStep.other.description}}</div>
              </div>

              <div class="txt txt--s fw-700 mt-16">
                <p>Financial Accounts in the Prospective Ward’s name:</p>
              </div>

              <div class="table-wrap bordered">
                <table>
                  <tr>
                    <td>Institution (PNC, Fidelity, etc.) </td>
                    <td>Type (checking, brokerage, etc.) </td>
                    <td>Estimated Balance</td>
                  </tr>
                  <tr>
                    <td>{{financialAccountStep.accounts.[0].institution}}</td>
                    <td>{{financialAccountStep.accounts.[0].type}}</td>
                    <td>{{financialAccountStep.accounts.[0].estimatedBalance}}</td>
                  </tr>
                  <tr>
                    <td>{{financialAccountStep.accounts.[1].institution}}</td>
                    <td>{{financialAccountStep.accounts.[1].type}}</td>
                    <td>{{financialAccountStep.accounts.[1].estimatedBalance}}</td>
                  </tr>
                  <tr>
                    <td>{{financialAccountStep.accounts.[2].institution}}</td>
                    <td>{{financialAccountStep.accounts.[2].type}}</td>
                    <td>{{financialAccountStep.accounts.[2].estimatedBalance}}</td>
                  </tr>
                  <tr>
                    <td>{{financialAccountStep.accounts.[3].institution}}</td>
                    <td>{{financialAccountStep.accounts.[3].type}}</td>
                    <td>{{financialAccountStep.accounts.[3].estimatedBalance}}</td>
                  </tr>
                </table>
              </div>

              <div class="txt txt--s fw-700 mt-16">
                <p>Real Estate Interests:</p>
              </div>
              <div class="flex v--end h--between gap-4">
                <div class="checkbox">{{#if propertyStep.isProspectiveWardRealEstateOwner}}✓{{/if}}</div>
                <div class="txt txt--s w-auto">The prospective ward owns real estate located at the following address(es):</div>
                <div class="input fullw"></div>
              </div>
              <div class="flex v--end h--between gap-4">
                <div class="input fullw">{{propertyStep.realEstateAddress}}</div>
              </div>
              
            </div>

        </div>

        <footer class="mt-auto">
            <div class="flex v--center h--between">
              <div class="text--center fw-600 txt txt--s uppercase ml-auto mr-auto">
                FRANKLIN COUNTY FORM G-17.0F - PROSPECTIVE WARD'S FINANCIAL INFORMATION <br>(PAGE 1)
              </div>
            </div>
        </footer>
    </div>


    <!--page 2-->
    <div class="page">
        <header>
            <div class="text--right txt txt--xs">PC-G-17.0F (Rev. 8-2025)</div>
        </header>
        <div class="content">
          <div class="grid gap-16">
            <div class="flex v--end h--between gap-4">
              <div class="input fullw"></div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex v--end h--between gap-4">
              <div class="input fullw"></div>
            </div>

            <div class="flex v--end h--between gap-4">
              <div class="checkbox">{{#if propertyStep.prospectiveWardReceivesRentalIncome}}✓{{/if}}</div>
              <div class="txt txt--s w-auto">The prospective ward receives rental income in the amount of </div>
              <div class="input fullw">{{propertyStep.rentalIncomeAmount}}</div>
              <div class="txt txt--s w-auto">
                per month
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="txt txt--s fw-700 mt-10">
              <p>Estate and Trust Interests:</p>
            </div>

            <div class="flex v--end h--start gap-4">
              <div class="checkbox">
                {{#if assetsInterests.prospectiveWardBeneficiaryOf}}
                  ✓
                {{/if}}
              </div>
              <div class="txt txt--s w-auto">The prospective ward is the beneficiary of:</div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex v--end h--start gap-4 pl-20">
              <div class="checkbox">{{#includes assetsInterests.prospectiveWardBeneficiaryOf "specialNeedsTrust"}}✓{{/includes}}</div>
              <div class="txt txt--s w-auto">a special needs trust.</div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex v--end h--start gap-4 pl-20">
              <div class="checkbox">{{#includes assetsInterests.prospectiveWardBeneficiaryOf "otherTrust"}}✓{{/includes}}</div>
              <div class="txt txt--s w-auto">any other trust.</div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex v--end h--start gap-4 pl-20">
              <div class="checkbox">{{#includes assetsInterests.prospectiveWardBeneficiaryOf "decedentEstate"}}✓{{/includes}}</div>
              <div class="txt txt--s w-auto">a decedent’s estate.</div>
            </div>
            <div>
              <div class="txt txt--s mt-8">
                <p>Identifying information of the estate or trust (e.g., name of decedent or settlor, case number, court</p>
              </div>
              <div class="flex v--end h--between gap-4 mt-8">
                <div class="txt txt--s w-auto">overseeing the trust or estate, name of trustee, etc.):</div>
                <div class="input fullw"></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            {{#if assetsInterests.identifyingInformation}}
            <div class="flex v--end h--between gap-4">
              <div class="input fullw">{{assetsInterests.identifyingInformation}}</div>
            </div>
            {{else}}
            <div class="flex v--end h--between gap-4">
              <div class="input fullw"></div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex v--end h--between gap-4">
              <div class="input fullw"></div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex v--end h--between gap-4">
              <div class="input fullw"></div>
            </div>
            {{/if}}

            <div class="txt txt--s fw-700 mt-10">
              <p>Other Income or Assets (cash, securities, royalties, etc.):</p>
            </div>
            <div class="flex v--end h--between gap-4">
              <div class="txt txt--s w-auto">Source and amount:</div>
              <div class="input fullw"></div>
            </div>
            {{#or assetsInterests.sourceOfIncomeOrAsset assetsInterests.amountOfIncomeOrAsset}}
            <div class="flex v--end h--between gap-4">
              <div class="input fullw">{{assetsInterests.sourceOfIncomeOrAsset}} {{assetsInterests.amountOfIncomeOrAsset}}</div>
            </div>
            {{else}}
            <div class="flex v--end h--between gap-4">
              <div class="input fullw"></div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex v--end h--between gap-4">
              <div class="input fullw"></div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex v--end h--between gap-4">
              <div class="input fullw"></div>
            </div>
            {{/or}}

            <div class="txt txt--m fw-700 underline text--center mt-20">Application to Determine Indigent Status</div>
            <div class="txt txt--s fw-700 text--center">(Request to Avoid Court Costs for Prospective Ward)</div>
            <div class="txt txt--s">Based on the financial information above, I believe that the prospective ward:</div>
            <div class="flex v--start h--start gap-4 pl-30">
              <div class="checkbox">{{#ifEquals assetsInterests.hasSufficientFundsToPayCourtCosts true}}✓{{/ifEquals}}</div>
              <div class="txt txt--s w-auto">has enough funds available in their own name to pay court costs.</div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex v--start h--start gap-4 pl-30">
              <div class="checkbox">{{#ifEquals assetsInterests.doesNotHaveSufficientFundsToPayCourtCosts true}}✓{{/ifEquals}}</div>
              <div class="txt txt--s w-auto">does not have enough funds in their own name to pay court costs. The court should consider
whether the proposed ward can be considered indigent.</div>
            </div>
          </div>

            <div class="mt-20 pt-20 grid col-2 gap-20">
                <div class="col">
                </div>
                <div class="col">
                    <div class="row">
                        <div class="input fullw"></div>
                        <div class="txt txt--xs mt-4 text--center">Applicant Guardian</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <footer class="mt-auto">
            <div class="text--center fw-600 txt txt--s uppercase">
                FRANKLIN COUNTY FORM 20.0C - WAIVER OF NOTICE
            </div>
        </footer>
    </div>
</body>
</html>